		<description><![CDATA[
Earlier this year, we headed out to the old stomping grounds of Oahu, Hawaii to rock a show. We linked up with Kai Media to film a music video for HI-808, the song that inspired the rest of the OOF! EP. It was barely a week after we filmed the Coffee and Snow video, which [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><object classid="clsid:d27cdb6e-ae6d-11cf-96b8-444553540000" width="423" height="318" codebase="http://download.macromedia.com/pub/shockwave/cabs/flash/swflash.cab#version=6,0,40,0"><param name="flashvars" value="CONFIG_URL=http://www.mtvu.com/player/embed/configuration.jhtml%3fvid%3D424457" /><param name="src" value="http://www.mtvu.com/player/embed/" /><param name="wmode" value="transparent" /><param name="allowfullscreen" value="true" /><embed type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="423" height="318" src="http://www.mtvu.com/player/embed/" allowfullscreen="true" wmode="transparent" flashvars="CONFIG_URL=http://www.mtvu.com/player/embed/configuration.jhtml%3fvid%3D424457"></embed></object></p>
<p>Earlier this year, we headed out to the old stomping grounds of <strong>Oahu, Hawaii</strong> to rock a show. We linked up with <strong>Kai Media</strong> to film a music video for <strong>HI-808</strong>, the song that inspired the rest of the <em><strong>OOF! EP</strong></em>. It was barely a week after we filmed the <strong><a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qREupDMEPAU">Coffee and Snow</a></strong> video, which is why we look so damn happy here.</p>
<p>Check for the video in rotation on air (premiering all day Monday, August 10 starting 7AM PST/10AM EST) at <strong><a href="http://mtvu.com">MTVU</a></strong> or online at <strong><a href="http://www.mtvu.com/music/video-premiere/blue-scholars_hi-808/">MTVU.com</a></strong>. We encourage you all to share this with your friends. Mahalo.</p>
<p>Geo/Blue Scholars</p>
<p align="left"><a class="tt" href="http://twitter.com/home/?status=Check+@bluescholars+%22HI-808%22+MUSIC+VIDEO+PREMIERE+http://tinyurl.com/m2qggb" title="Post to Twitter"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-twitter-micro3.png" alt="Post to Twitter" border="0" /></a>&nbsp; <a class="tt" href="http://digg.com/submit?url=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/08/hi-808-music-video-premiere/&amp;title=%22HI-808%22+MUSIC+VIDEO+PREMIERE" title="Post to Digg"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-digg-micro3.png" alt="Post to Digg" border="0" /></a>&nbsp; <a class="tt" href="http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/08/hi-808-music-video-premiere/&amp;t=%22HI-808%22+MUSIC+VIDEO+PREMIERE" title="Post to Facebook"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-facebook-micro3.png" alt="Post to Facebook" border="0" /></a>&nbsp; <a class="tt" href="http://www.myspace.com/Modules/PostTo/Pages/?l=3&amp;u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/08/hi-808-music-video-premiere/&amp;t=%22HI-808%22+MUSIC+VIDEO+PREMIERE&amp;c=%3Cp%3EPowered+by+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Frichardxthripp.thripp.com%2Ftweet-this%22%3ETweet+This%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E" title="Post to MySpace"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-myspace-micro3.png" alt="Post to MySpace" border="0" /></a></p>]]></content:encoded>
