		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/?p=382</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[
Remember this name: Aaron Yoshino. Because you&#8217;ll be hearing alot around here in the upcoming months, and sooner than later, everywhere. He&#8217;s the Bay Area-translplanted, Hawaii-based photographer/homie/media guy who&#8217;s documented our last two trips to the island, and is the art director for the upcoming OOF! EP. He runs this super-quality photo blog Honozooloo Media [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-383" title="img_9707-vi" src="http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/08/img_9707-vi.jpg" alt="img_9707-vi" width="400" /></p>
<p>Remember this name: <strong>Aaron Yoshino</strong>. Because you&#8217;ll be hearing alot around here in the upcoming months, and sooner than later, everywhere. He&#8217;s the Bay Area-translplanted, Hawaii-based photographer/homie/media guy who&#8217;s documented our last two trips to the island, and is the art director for the upcoming <strong>OOF! EP</strong>. He runs this super-quality photo blog <strong><a href="http://www.honozooloo.com/">Honozooloo Media</a><span style="font-weight: normal;"> and has photographed such luminaries as Barack Obama and Blue Scholars</span></strong>. Check the Honozoolo Media Archive links below to our flicks from our previous visists.</p>
